                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "7410863",
            "initDialog": "741086301",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "741086301",
                    "speaker": "Player",
                    "text": "Looking real cute today, Ms. Elphane!"
                },
                {
                    "id": "741086302",
                    "speaker": "Elphane",
                    "text": "What!?"
                },
                {
                    "id": "741086303",
                    "speaker": "Elphane",
                    "text": "P—Please refrain from jokes in such poor taste, dear passenger!"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "7410864",
            "initDialog": "741086401",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "741086401",
                    "speaker": "Player",
                    "text": "How many times faster would the aquabus be with you at the helm?"
                },
                {
                    "id": "741086402",
                    "speaker": "Elphane",
                    "text": "Aquabus engine outputs cannot be changed by the identity of the driver."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "7410865",
            "initDialog": "741086501",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "741086501",
                    "speaker": "Player",
                    "text": "This trip."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "7410866",
            "initDialog": "741086601",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "741086601",
                    "speaker": "Player",
                    "text": "Tell me about the Court of Fontaine..."
                },
                {
                    "id": "741086602",
                    "speaker": "Elphane",
                    "text": "A natural point of interest is The Steambird. As for the reason it's recommended... This is what was written — \"Whatever, just find a way to recommend it.\""
                },
                {
                    "id": "741086603",
                    "speaker": "Player",
                    "text": "Sure, sure. Any personal recommendations?"
                },
                {
                    "id": "741086604",
                    "speaker": "Elphane",
                    "text": "Yes. First, Bertin's House of Curiosities and Chioriya Boutique. Both of them sell very... cute clothes. They even have gloves custom-fit for Melusines. Not that I'm interested or anything!"
                },
                {
                    "id": "741086605",
                    "speaker": "Elphane",
                    "text": "Otherwise, my friends and I often go to Café Lutece. The smell of coffee is just too good — even better than Emilie's perfume."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "7410867",
            "initDialog": "741086701",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "741086701",
                    "speaker": "Player",
                    "text": "See you."
                },
                {
                    "id": "741086702",
                    "speaker": "Elphane",
                    "text": "See you."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "7410868",
            "initDialog": "741086801",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "741086801",
                    "speaker": "Player",
                    "text": "That was a real memorable trip!"
                },
                {
                    "id": "741086802",
                    "speaker": "Elphane",
                    "text": "That's great. Please allow me to thank you on behalf of the Court Region Waterway Hub and the aquabus itself for your praise."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "7410869",
            "initDialog": "741086901",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "741086901",
                    "speaker": "Player",
                    "text": "It was faster than the Clementine Line, anyway..."
                },
                {
                    "id": "741086902",
                    "speaker": "Elphane",
                    "text": "Objectively speaking, the Navia Line is shorter. As such — aquabus speeds being equal — your senses match reality."
                },
                {
                    "id": "741086903",
                    "speaker": "Player",
                    "text": "But..."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "7410870",
            "initDialog": "741087001",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "741087001",
                    "speaker": "Player",
                    "text": "The scenery was pretty good."
                },
                {
                    "id": "741087002",
                    "speaker": "Elphane",
                    "text": "Very good."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "7410871",
            "initDialog": "741087101",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "741087101",
                    "speaker": "Player",
                    "text": "Your explanation was very good, Ms. Elphane."
                },
                {
                    "id": "741087102",
                    "speaker": "Elphane",
                    "text": "What!?"
                },
                {
                    "id": "741087103",
                    "speaker": "Elphane",
                    "text": "P—Please refrain from jokes in such poor taste, dear passenger!"
                },
                {
                    "id": "741087104",
                    "speaker": "Elphane",
                    "text": "*cough* If you like listening to explanations, I personally recommend that you ride the Clementine Line, on which Aeval serves as a guide."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "7410872",
            "initDialog": "741087201",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "741087201",
                    "speaker": "Player",
                    "text": "That was way too slow."
                },
                {
                    "id": "741087202",
                    "speaker": "Elphane",
                    "text": "\"The Court Region Waterway Hub and the Fontaine Research Institute of Kinetic Energy Engineering are working to improve aquabus speed.\""
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
